{"id":"jg33v0hkdr6f12tul1y3zl4xj","title":"清代直隶民间碑刻中的巡抚断案","originalTitle":"右谕通知","summary":"清代直隶（今河北）的水利、护林等事务多由知县审结并立碑晓谕，此类碑刻数量众多。巡抚层级裁断并刻碑的情况较为稀见，如方受籌在道光元年（1821）处理的一起案件，因其判词具备示范价值而被镌刻成碑，此类碑刻价值高于常见的知县告示碑。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=2687371&do=blog&id=1561488"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T03:38:40.422Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T03:38:40.422Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":20,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}